  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a casserole. Roughly chop the onion and finely chop the garlic.",
    "Soften the onion and garlic in the oil over a medium heat. Add the rice and stir until translucent.",
    "Cover with the stock and cook on a low heat until the liquid is absorbed, stirring regularly so the rice does not stick.",
    "Mash the avocados and stir in with the lemon juice. Season with pepper, and salt if needed. Eat at once, with toasted pine nuts or pistachios for crunch."
